urpm (2.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Move to a new computer: save your apps, reinstall them anywhere.
  * Command-line companion: urpm list, search, info, updates, dupes, clean,
    history, export, backup and restore.
  * Flatpak permissions in plain words, and each app's data folder.
  * Translations: Arabic, German, Spanish, French and Brazilian Portuguese.
  * "Just mine" no longer counts the packages the installer put on the system.

